/// Returns `result` from `mq3.renderer.qgl_linked.qglNames`.
function qglNames() result=[];for each pair in aliases() result=result+[pair[0]] end for;return result end function
/// Returns `""` from `mq3.renderer.qgl_linked.glName`; earlier branches return `pair[1]`.
/// @param name Input used by `for each pair in aliases() if pair[0]==name then return pair[1]`.
function glName(name) for each pair in aliases() if pair[0]==name then return pair[1] end if end for;return "" end function
/// Computes `glName(name)!=""` for `mq3.renderer.qgl_linked.contains`.
/// @param name Value forwarded as `name` to `mq3.renderer.qgl_linked.glName`.
function contains(name) return glName(name)!="" end function
